### The versioned routes live under /api/v1. This one lists the readiness checks
### that are registered, a page at a time: the reference for list endpoints.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### A page of registered checks (the database, Redis and storage).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/checks?page=1&pageSize=25

### A validation error: page 0 is refused with VALIDATION_FAILED and a field list.
### The traceId in the body is the X-Request-Id of this request.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/checks?page=0
X-Request-Id: bad-page-001
